WEBVTT

NOTE
Approving a reply, BistroTech help. Captions written by record_valasz.mjs,
timed to the recorded taps. v0.2.0, 2026-09-26.

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.902 line:2% size:92% align:center
Open the Válaszok (Replies) tab.

2
00:00:02.902 --> 00:00:06.102 line:2% size:92% align:center
Next to the tab you can see
how many replies are waiting.

3
00:00:06.102 --> 00:00:10.119 line:2% size:92% align:center
The worst review comes first.
Read it. Below is the ready reply.

4
00:00:10.119 --> 00:00:12.901 line:2% size:92% align:center
Edit it if you need to.

5
00:00:12.901 --> 00:00:17.303 line:2% size:92% align:center
With the Átírás (Rewrite) buttons
you can ask for it shorter,
warmer or firmer,

6
00:00:17.303 --> 00:00:20.106 line:2% size:92% align:center
or switch it to formal
or informal address.

7
00:00:20.106 --> 00:00:22.920 line:2% size:92% align:center
You can restore the original
at any time.

8
00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:25.711 line:2% size:92% align:center
Press Jóváhagyás (Approve).

9
00:00:25.711 --> 00:00:28.672 line:2% size:92% align:center
You can undo it
for eight seconds.

10
00:00:28.672 --> 00:00:34.663 line:2% size:92% align:center
If you have added us as a manager
on Google, we post the reply
within a few minutes.

11
00:00:34.663 --> 00:00:38.965 line:2% size:92% align:center
If not, copy it with one button
and paste it on Google.

12
00:00:38.965 --> 00:00:43.579 line:2% size:92% align:center
Faster with a keyboard:
A approves, S closes without
a reply, J and K move, E edits,

13
00:00:43.579 --> 00:00:46.182 line:2% size:92% align:center
O opens Google,
U undoes.
